{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Hope Timbre, you guide a mysterious creature through imaginary realm at night, or help two siblings awaken their broken world during the day.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In dreams, you traverse the colorful environments, manipulate the architecture to solve puzzles and find various hope instruments. These are musical instruments, songs, friendly creatures or pieces of a book.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After children wake up, they use them to heal themselves, grow their old tree, summon the spring and escape the never-ending cycle.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873610/extras/02c30dcefa28d6539078ef65db0d9002.poster.avif?t=1763561714\" width=616 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873610/extras/02c30dcefa28d6539078ef65db0d9002.webm?t=1763561714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873610/extras/02c30dcefa28d6539078ef65db0d9002.mp4?t=1763561714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Features:</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique type of puzzles utilizing full 3d space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hope instruments and songs to transform the cold world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate the world as it heals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear game progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls are simple yet complex puzzles are possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adaptive soundtrack - audio reflects actions in puzzle levels, while it adapts to overall game progression in real world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873610/extras/75b82e7fbba3ea53902e96d6fe287182.avif?t=1763561714\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2873610?t=1763561714","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873610/f20e660de4ed2a7417726a7c68e5da51afb6ba26/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763561714","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873610/a0d7c241a129de4297ac50497aa2dcdf242236d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763561714","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873610/a0d7c241a129de4297ac50497aa2dcdf242236d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763561714","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4096820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Hope Timbre, you guide a mysterious creature through imaginary realm at night, or help two siblings awaken their broken world during the day.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In dreams, you traverse the colorful environments, manipulate the architecture to solve puzzles and find various hope instruments. These are musical instruments, songs, friendly creatures or pieces of a book.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After children wake up, they use them to heal themselves, grow their old tree, summon the spring and escape the never-ending cycle.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=